I found one additional failure path inside the same supervisor blocker: the launch-state transition could return early without terminating the still-suspended child. I’ve changed that path to confirm termination and report `browser_cleanup_failed` if confirmation fails; I also removed handle leaks so RAII closes them and preserves job-handle close as a fallback. Next I’m tackling explicit finalization, which must include the signal wrapper and cannot be solved by a `Drop` tweak alone.
